{"sha": "6add6f344651b3fd917869562ef64602c7056130175f4cedb0af979dac108a12", "body": ["\\begin{proof}", "1. 设 $0 < u < v$，则", "\\[", "f(v) - f(u) = \\frac1v - \\frac1u = \\frac{u - v}{uv} < 0,", "\\]", "由 $u - v < 0$ 且 $uv > 0$，知函数在", "$\\intoo{0}{+\\infty}$ 上严格递减。在 $\\intoo{-\\infty}{0}$ 上，同一商式的", "$u - v < 0$ 与 $uv > 0$ 再次成立（两个负数之积），故 $f$", "在该区间上同样递减。", "", "2. $\\frac{1}{-x} = -\\frac1x$.", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{remark}", "注意：$\\frac1x$ \\emph{并非}在其整个定义域上递减。", "取 $u = -1$，$v = 1$，则函数值由 $-1$ 跃升至 $1$。两个分支", "必须分别研究。", "\\end{remark}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}", "\\begin{axis}[omaxis,", "  width=5.6cm, height=5.2cm,", "  xmin=-3.2, xmax=3.2, ymin=-2.6, ymax=6.4,", "  xtick={-2,-1,1,2}, ytick={1,4},", "  title={$y = x^2$}]", "  \\addplot[omDef, thick, domain=-2.45:2.45, samples=90] {x^2};", "\\end{axis}", "\\end{tikzpicture}\\hfill", "\\begin{tikzpicture}", "\\begin{axis}[omaxis,", "  width=5.6cm, height=5.2cm,", "  xmin=-3.4, xmax=3.4, ymin=-3.4, ymax=3.4,", "  xtick={-1,1}, ytick={-1,1},", "  title={$y = \\frac1x$}]", "  \\addplot[omDef, thick, domain=0.3:3.1, samples=80] {1/x};", "  \\addplot[omDef, thick, domain=-3.1:-0.3, samples=80] {1/x};", "\\end{axis}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 抛物线 $y = x^2$（关于纵轴对称）与", "双曲线 $y = \\frac1x$（两支，关于原点对称）。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\section{平方根与立方}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[平方根函数]\\label{prop:g10:reffunc:sqrt}", "函数 $f(x) = \\sqrt{x}$ 定义在 $\\intco{0}{+\\infty}$ 上，", "严格递增。", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "设 $0 \\leq u < v$。分子分母同乘以\\emph{共轭因式}：", "\\[", "\\sqrt v - \\sqrt u", "= \\frac{(\\sqrt v - \\sqrt u)(\\sqrt v + \\sqrt u)}{\\sqrt v + \\sqrt u}", "= \\frac{v - u}{\\sqrt v + \\sqrt u} > 0,", "\\]", "因 $v - u > 0$ 且 $\\sqrt v + \\sqrt u > 0$（注意 $v > 0$，故", "$\\sqrt v > 0$）。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[立方函数]\\label{prop:g10:reffunc:cube}", "函数 $f(x) = x^3$ 定义在 $\\R$ 上，严格递增，且", "其图像关于原点对称。", "\\end{proposition}", "\\admitted", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}", "\\begin{axis}[omaxis,", "  width=5.6cm, height=5.0cm,", "  xmin=-0.7, xmax=5.4, ymin=-0.7, ymax=2.9,", "  xtick={1,4}, ytick={1,2},", "  title={$y = \\sqrt x$}]", "  \\addplot[omDef, thick, domain=0:5.1, samples=100] {sqrt(x)};", "\\end{axis}", "\\end{tikzpicture}\\hfill", "\\begin{tikzpicture}", "\\begin{axis}[omaxis,", "  width=5.6cm, height=5.0cm,", "  xmin=-2.2, xmax=2.2, ymin=-3.4, ymax=3.4,", "  xtick={-1,1}, ytick={-1,1},", "  title={$y = x^3$}]", "  \\addplot[omDef, thick, domain=-1.48:1.48, samples=90] {x^3};", "\\end{axis}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 平方根（仅对 $x \\geq 0$ 有定义）与立方，两者", "均递增。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[比较 $x$、$x^2$ 与 $\\sqrt x$]\\label{prop:g10:reffunc:compare}", "当 $0 < x < 1$ 时：\\ \\ $x^2 < x < \\sqrt x$。\\quad", "当 $x > 1$ 时：\\ \\ $\\sqrt x < x < x^2$。\\quad", "当 $x = 0$ 与 $x = 1$ 时，三者的值相等。", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "设 $0 < x < 1$。将 $x < 1$ 两边同乘 $x > 0$，得 $x^2 < x$。", "其次证明 $x < \\sqrt x$：由于两边均为正，且在正数上平方是", "递增的，故该不等式等价于", "$x^2 < x$（已证）。当 $x > 1$ 时，将 $x > 1$ 两边同乘 $x$，", "得 $x^2 > x$，同样由上述平方论证可得 $\\sqrt x < x$。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}", "\\begin{axis}[omaxis,", "  width=7.4cm, height=5.8cm,", "  xmin=-0.35, xmax=2.5, ymin=-0.35, ymax=2.9,", "  xtick={1,2}, ytick={1,2}]", "  \\addplot[omThm, thick, domain=0:1.65, samples=80] {x^2};", "  \\addplot[omDef, thick, domain=0:2.35] {x};", "  \\addplot[omMeth, thick, domain=0:2.35, samples=80] {sqrt(x)};", "  \\fill (axis cs:1,1) circle (1.5pt);", "  \\node[omThm, font=\\small, right] at (axis cs:1.45,2.4) {$y = x^2$};", "  \\node[omDef, font=\\small, right] at (axis cs:2.0,1.85) {$y = x$};", "  \\node[omMeth, font=\\small, right] at (axis cs:2.0,1.28) {$y = \\sqrt x$};", "\\end{axis}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", ""]}